{"id":"vod_md_5548","vodId":"5548","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"田中君总是如此慵懒","name_cn":"田中君总是如此慵懒","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231002-1/ee02270f5376698cc039a462c936cb9e.jpg"},"summary":"田中（小野贤章 配音）是1-F班的学生，身体孱弱的他长着一副宛如女孩子般的秀气面孔，讲起话来亦细声细语，还常常讲到一半就因为体力不支而睡着。无论何时，田中都是一副迷迷糊糊的困倦模样，生活中任何麻烦的事情都和他无缘。长相有些凶恶的太田（细谷佳正 配音）常常被人误认为是不良少年，但实际上，他却担任着田中身边“保姆”的职责，在生活之中对他照顾有加并且乐在其中。活泼开朗的元气少女宫野（高森奈津美 配音）一直暗恋着大姐头越前（诹访彩花 配音），为了能够成为和越前相配的同伴，宫野拜了田中为师，向他学习稳重慵懒之道。充满了欢乐的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-02 08:16:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/dHBXqn9K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/uhgHfdPC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/UAauFYGw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/6QACJPD3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/X3gwc1Cm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/1Pl9RenW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/ot5OzdMQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/iFNNKou9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/hpDebQo3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/bhWZ6jHr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/0riSIRMO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/RVtlG9XV/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:01.649Z"}